// Drives are chemicals (the Creatures rule): drive d lives at chemical 1 + d.
// Saved brain weights are keyed by drive id, so adding a row keeps every saved
// brain loadable (the new column starts at zero; instincts teach it).
//
// BLORB_DRIVE(id, name)
BLORB_DRIVE(0, hunger)
BLORB_DRIVE(1, sleepiness)
BLORB_DRIVE(2, boredom)
BLORB_DRIVE(3, loneliness)
BLORB_DRIVE(4, fear)
BLORB_DRIVE(5, pain)
BLORB_DRIVE(6, discomfort)
BLORB_DRIVE(7, need_touch)   // lowered by cradling and petting, so affection is rewarding
